# Error Display (FE validation vs API failure)

## FE validation error (client-side)
- Placement: show validation message directly under the corresponding input field.
- Style: message text color is red.
- Style: input field border color is red when there is a validation error.

## API failure error (server-side)
- When API call fails: show a toast notification.
- Toast message content: use the error message returned from BE.
